{"id":"643651","name":"乌鸡蛋拌油菜芯","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643651/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"双黄乌鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"油菜嫩芯","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"乌鸡蛋煮熟。","img":"images/643651/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去壳切块。","img":"images/643651/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"油菜洗净，先把菜梗部分煮一下。","img":"images/643651/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放开水里整个煮熟。","img":"images/643651/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出装盘。","img":"images/643651/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮一点胡萝卜。","img":"images/643651/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/643651/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放油菜上。","img":"images/643651/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"当时鸡蛋。","img":"images/643651/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淋上辣白菜的汤汁即可。","img":"images/643651/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643651/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"胡萝卜可有可无，我仅仅是觉得油菜芯不够多，就放了点胡萝卜。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}